1
00:47:03,951 --> 00:47:05,285
Yes, they're my house guests.

2
00:47:05,720 --> 00:47:08,858
Well, when my crew
arrives we'll be busy for a while...

3
00:47:08,864 --> 00:47:10,790
- so I'd suggest that...
- That we go to our rooms?

4
00:47:10,820 --> 00:47:13,412
- That's very good idea.
- Come on girls.

5
00:47:16,973 --> 00:47:20,081
What about a police guard for
this house tonight Lieutenant?

6
00:47:20,111 --> 00:47:21,318
You've got one.

7
00:47:21,937 --> 00:47:24,411
I'm going to cover this place tonight
from the attic to the basement.

8
00:47:24,638 --> 00:47:27,761
If the Bat makes another call,
I'll have a little surprise for him.

9
00:47:29,707 --> 00:47:34,943
Who, who is he? Have you any idea?

10
00:47:40,510 --> 00:47:41,476
He could be anybody.

11
00:47:41,506 --> 00:47:45,595
So far, there are clues to his identity
but nothing we could take before a jury.

12
00:47:47,074 --> 00:47:49,910
I am afraid we must look
higher than the criminal world.

13
00:47:50,680 --> 00:47:53,924
He may be a
merchant, lawyer, doctor, scientist.

14
00:47:54,573 --> 00:47:56,278
One of the pillars of his community.

15
00:47:58,014 --> 00:48:01,107
Ladies, lock your
doors tonight, stay behind them.

16
00:48:01,589 --> 00:48:05,391
- I promise you you'll be safe, good night.
- Good night Lieutenant.

17
00:48:39,233 --> 00:48:41,904
- Poor Mark.
- Yeah, it's a pity.

18
00:48:42,236 --> 00:48:46,943
- So young.
- Well doctor, do you agree it was the Bat?

19
00:48:47,683 --> 00:48:49,436
In my report, I shall say the death was...

20
00:48:49,466 --> 00:48:52,210
caused by the same
technique used in the other killings.

21
00:48:52,828 --> 00:48:57,875
A paralyzing blow to the throat, followed
by severe lacerations of the jugular...

22
00:48:58,496 --> 00:49:00,684
resulting in excessive hemorrhage.

23
00:49:01,363 --> 00:49:03,886
In a layman's language,
he didn't know what hit him.

24
00:49:04,249 --> 00:49:09,020
Oh, he knew, but he didn't
have time to think about it.

25
00:49:17,714 --> 00:49:19,207
You staying here tonight Andy?

26
00:49:19,388 --> 00:49:21,856
Well, until I check the
doors and windows but

27
00:49:21,880 --> 00:49:24,348
I'll be back bright and
early in the morning.

28
00:49:25,117 --> 00:49:28,177
Neither snow nor rain
nor heat nor gloom of night...

29
00:49:28,207 --> 00:49:31,886
stays these couriers from the swift
completion of their appointed rounds.

30
00:49:32,398 --> 00:49:35,217
A lot of people are due for a
shock when I close this case.

31
00:49:36,333 --> 00:49:40,464
Yes, I'm sure they are.
Good night Andy, don't get hurt.

32
00:49:42,217 --> 00:49:43,133
Good night, doctor.

33
00:49:57,604 --> 00:49:59,657
You know, I think we'd
better let get some sleep.

34
00:49:59,658 --> 00:50:02,699
Oh well Lizzie and I share
this room for mutual protection.

35
00:50:02,956 --> 00:50:06,324
You know, one night, a storm blew
the wires down, put the lights out...

36
00:50:06,325 --> 00:50:08,946
and when I went out the next day and
bought a half a dozen of these things.

37
00:50:08,976 --> 00:50:11,401
- You better take one with you Dale.
- Oh, thank you.

38
00:50:13,361 --> 00:50:14,606
We'll go across the hall.

39
00:50:14,630 --> 00:50:16,982
Are you sure there's
nothing else you need?

40
00:50:17,012 --> 00:50:18,749
- No.
- Quite sure, we'll be all right.

41
00:50:18,779 --> 00:50:21,211
Well, if anything
bothers you, you just sing out.

42
00:50:21,346 --> 00:50:23,673
And two strong
women will come to your rescue.

43
00:50:24,474 --> 00:50:27,033
Oh, nothing will bother us,
not with Andy on the job.

44
00:50:27,545 --> 00:50:29,090
- Good night.
- Good night.

45
00:50:29,350 --> 00:50:30,963
Don't worry, everything will be all right.

46
00:50:31,349 --> 00:50:32,479
- Good night.
- Good night.

47
00:50:33,849 --> 00:50:34,643
Come on Lizzie.

48
00:50:57,372 --> 00:51:01,389
- No, I don't think I'll sleep tonight.
- Me neither.

49
00:51:02,142 --> 00:51:06,580
All I can see is poor
Mark Fleming staring at us.

50
00:51:07,523 --> 00:51:11,932
I thought that when people died
their eyes closed, as in sleep.
